hiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"auto_gtin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight_img\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"electronics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tau_high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.92</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tau_low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.72</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight_attr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"review_queue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_daily\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"order_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"impact_score DESC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"abs(score - tau_high) ASC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"label_sink\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"match_label\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"guard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"price_ratio_veto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"paper_price_depth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>impact_score</code> 的构造建议是&quot;该竞品报价被引用的下游 SKU 数 × 价格竞争力权重&quot;，它保证复核人力先花在会真正影响定价的匹配上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与下游的接口\">与下游的接口</h2><p>匹配结果不是终点，而是一个带置信度的关系表。每条关系记录必须至少包含：双方 product_id、匹配方法（哪几路召回命中）、综合分数、证据快照（当时的标题/图片 hash/属性对）、评审状态（自动/人工确认/已否决）、以及版本化的策略标识。这样下游的 <a href=\"competitor-catalog-normalize\">竞品目录归一与置信度</a> 才能做跨站归并，<a href=\"../price-intelligence-data/price-cleanse-anomaly\">价格清洗与异常/运费陷阱</a> 才能按置信度决定清洗严格度，<a href=\"../repricing-rule-engine/repricing-rule-guardrail\">跟价规则与利润/品牌价护栏</a> 才能把&quot;只跟高置信竞品&quot;写成规则。</p>\n<p>一个常被忽略的接口约定是：<strong>匹配关系必须有失效时间</strong>。竞品可能下架、换款、改标题；一条 2024 年建立的匹配关系不能默认在 2026 年仍然成立。实务做法是给 <code>match_link</code> 加 <code>valid_from/valid_to</code> 与 <code>last_verified_at</code>，并在每次采集时重新校验关键证据（GTIN、主体图 hash、容量属性）。证据变化就触发重打分，而不是无条件沿用旧结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨站同款匹配的正确形态是多路召回加融合打分，不存在单一万能相似度函数。</li>\n<li>强标识符（GTIN/MPN）覆盖率低但能给出确定性结论，必须先归一到统一宽度并校验校验位，无效编码不参与强匹配。</li>\n<li>文本通道要处理多语言与营销词污染，做法是属性词加权 + 高频词 IDF 降权；视觉通道跨语言最稳，但需裁剪主体并配合规格交叉验证。</li>\n<li>价格是校验信号而非匹配信号；用价格召回会造成&quot;匹配与价格互相污染&quot;的循环依赖。</li>\n<li>阈值必须不对称，分自动采纳/人工复核/丢弃三段；复核队列按信息增益与影响面排序。</li>\n<li>匹配置信度与证据快照必须一路透传到下游，审计时才能回答&quot;这次改价依据的是哪条匹配&quot;。</li>\n<li>匹配关系必须有失效时间与定期复验，防止下架、换款、改标题后的陈旧结论继续驱动改价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨站同款商品识别匹配","id":"跨站同款商品识别匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"特征提取与多路召回","id":"特征提取与多路召回"},{"level":3,"text":"标识符归一：GTIN 为什么是首选","id":"标识符归一-gtin-为什么是首选"},{"level":3,"text":"文本通道：多语言标题的处理","id":"文本通道-多语言标题的处理"},{"level":3,"text":"视觉通道：图片是跨语言的锚","id":"视觉通道-图片是跨语言的锚"},{"level":3,"text":"规格与价格一致性校验","id":"规格与价格一致性校验"},{"level":2,"text":"打分融合与阈值决策","id":"打分融合与阈值决策"},{"level":3,"text":"融合模型与可解释性","id":"融合模型与可解释性"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么阈值必须不对称","id":"为什么阈值必须不对称"},{"level":3,"text":"复核队列的排序与有限人力","id":"复核队列的排序与有限人力"},{"level":2,"text":"与下游的接口","id":"与下游的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"价格采集渠道与合规边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/competitor-product-match/price-scrape-compliance"}}